(
    title: "Brain Drain",
    developer: Some("Visual Impact"),
    description: Some("A grid of symbols scrambled out of order, with the pattern you must rebuild shown in the corner. A cursor holds four tiles at a time and rotates them clockwise or back, and a countdown runs while you match the model. Harder settings add sabotage: the controls invert, blocks turn on their own, whole rows hide behind question marks."),
